MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5acf2cf32a9b1134ea7a8b6ad6b27ae6, type: 3}
  m_Name: Building
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuacxiconSO
  categories:
  - categoryName: Locked
    contentList:
    - Haven't learned this yet!
    - What could this be?
    - Still discovering...
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Farm
    contentList:
    - has become the farmer with the last kick.
    - "Farmland: Grows crops. Ducks can collect them when it's time to harvest, or
      water them when not! \n[b]\n[c]\nUnlocking Condition: Collect 10 crumbies from
      the grass!"
    - Your citizens remembered how to farm! Build and harvest from farms to keep
      them from going hungry.
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Nest
    contentList:
    - has just built a love nest
    - "Nest: Two ducks can breed and hatch a baby! \n[b]\n[c]"
    - Your ducks remembered how to build nests! Those should be useful in keeping
      the population from dropping. (Which would be bad.)
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Playground
    contentList:
    - wants to play and built a playground. Hurray!
    - 'Playground: A place for ducks to relax after working hard. Boosts happiness
      of ducks!

      [b]

      [c]

      Unlocking Condition: Have 5 ducks.'
    - Hey, people are starting to get unhappy...I drew up some plans for a playground.
      Maybe that will cheer them up?
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Goldencorn
    contentList:
    - just jump into capitalism by finish building the Golden corn
    - "Golden Corn: Ducks will go straight to the nearest farm or grass when touching
      it or when the horn blows. \n[b]\n[c]\nUnlocking Condition: Build 2 farmlands."
    - Have you ever heard of golden corn? Building it can remind ducks to farm!
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Compostsite
    contentList:
    - has made the gorgeous Compostsite
    - 'Compost Site: Every farm or grass within its range will produce more crumbies
      when ducks collide with it.

      [b]

      [c]

      Unlock Condition:
      Build 3 Farmland.'
    - 'Hey, your citizens remembered something else about farming: compost!

      ...gross!'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Secretsite
    contentList:
    - built a secret site for deep dark fantasys.
    - "Mr Duckson's Secret Site: Ducks can stores crumbies here. \n[b]\n[c]\nUnlock
      Condition: Collect 300 crumbies from all sources."
    - Your citizens have learned about investment banking! If you set aside some
      crumbs for a Mr. Duckson, I've heard he might give you a hefty return.
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Hammersaw
    contentList:
    - has just built a hammersaw
    - 'Hammer & Saw Symmbol: Ducks will go straight to the nearest construction site
      when they make contact.

      [b]

      [c]

      Unlock Condition: Build
      3 buildings in total.'
    - Have you ever heard of the symbol of the hammer and saw? Building it can remind
      your ducks to construct new buildings!
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Strawcraft
    contentList:
    - built a strawcraft for yourcraft.
    - "Straw Craft: This will force ducks to stay in a work area for several duck
      minutes and produce crumbies. \n[b]\n[c]\nUnlock Condition: Collect 30 crumbies
      from Farmland in total."
    - 'Straw Craft unlocked! Ducks have learnt a new way to produce more crumbies:
      doing labors and making the raw materials into advanced products, after collecting
      many raw materials from the farmlands!'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Altar
    contentList:
    - has triggered the apocolypse.
    - "Altar: Sacrifice one duck to produce more crumbies. \n[b]\n[c]\nUnlock Condition:
      Have 6 ducks.\nCan only be placed once."
    - Altar unlocked! Overpopulation is dangerous! Ducks have figured out a way to
      deal with this problem... Their Gods will reward them for building this altar!
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Drum
    contentList:
    - do not know why but made some drums to play
    - 'Duck duck Drum: When the drum roars the speed of ducks increase!

      [b]

      [c]

      Unlock
      Condition: Ducks collide buildings 20 times in total.'
    - 'Duck duck drum unlocked! Ducks have learnt the benefit of walking like a New
      Yorker after working enough times in different buildings. '
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
  - categoryName: Dininghall
    contentList:
    - built another dining hall!
    - 'Dining Hall: ducks will store crumbs here to eat at the end of the month.

      [b]

      [c]

      Unlock
      Condition: have six ducks.'
    sourceTxtFile: {fileID: 0}
    targetCategoryName: 
    clearExistingContent: 0
